WEBVTT

00:02:56.672 --> 00:03:01.894
A broken-open heart is awake
and alive and calls for action.

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:05.633
It is regenerative, like nature,

00:03:06.562 --> 00:03:09.520
reclaiming ruined ground, growing anew.

00:03:10.351 --> 00:03:14.091
Life moves inexorably toward more life,

00:03:14.115 --> 00:03:15.723
toward healing,

00:03:15.747 --> 00:03:17.027
toward wholeness.

00:03:17.734 --> 00:03:20.282
That's a fundamental ecological truth.

00:03:21.001 --> 00:03:23.471
And we, all of us,

00:03:24.222 --> 00:03:26.107
we are life force.

00:03:27.849 --> 00:03:32.049
On the face of it, the primary link
between women, girls and a warming world